    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d492">

                <pb facs="0523" n="489" sameAs="frus:frus1897/pg489"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Taylor to Mr.
                            Sherman.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-04-20"><hi rendition="#italic">April 20,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Long note just received opposing objections to Hernsheim case, chief of which are
                    that, as presented here it rests upon general statements unsupported by proof,
                    and that claimants waited until last September to solicit permission to ship.
                    Promise made, however, to reexamine case as soon as expediente arrives. Have
                    claimants offered proof to officials at Havana?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Taylor.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
